[78.358798, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ selectors parse key=value \u001b[90m(1.459112ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ resources group by branch tag \u001b[90m(0.248395ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ summary warns about untagged resources \u001b[90m(0.363008ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ plan includes untagged resources created by the branch's stack \u001b[90m(0.334334ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ plan deletes dependents before the resources they depend on \u001b[90m(0.28615ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mℹ tests 6\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mℹ suites 0\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mℹ pass 5\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mℹ fail 1\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mℹ cancelled 0\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mℹ skipped 0\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mℹ todo 0\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mℹ duration_ms 314.842036\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n\u001b[31m✖ failing tests:\u001b[39m\r\n\r\ntest at test/cli.test.ts:29:1\r\n\u001b[31m✖ CLI recognises labels across pages for list, plan, gc and safe teardown \u001b[90m(171.481681ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n  AssertionError [ERR_ASSERTION]: Expected values to be strictly deep-equal:\r\n  \u001b[32m+ actual\u001b[39m \u001b[31m- expected\u001b[39m\r\n  \r\n  \u001b[39m  [\r\n  \u001b[39m    'boot',\r\n  \u001b[31m-\u001b[39m   'custom',\r\n  \u001b[31m-\u001b[39m   'custom-boot',\r\n  \u001b[39m    'net',\r\n  \u001b[31m-\u001b[39m   'new',\r\n  \u001b[31m-\u001b[39m   'new-boot',\r\n  \u001b[39m    'old'\r\n  \u001b[39m  ]\r\n  \r\n      at TestContext.<anonymous> \u001b[90m(file:///app/\u001b[39mtest/cli.test.ts:64:12\u001b[90m)\u001b[39m\r\n  \u001b[90m    at process.processTicksAndRejections (node:internal/process/task_queues:103:5)\u001b[39m\r\n  \u001b[90m    at async Test.run (node:internal/test_runner/test:1054:7)\u001b[39m\r\n  \u001b[90m    at async startSubtestAfterBootstrap (node:internal/test_runner/harness:296:3)\u001b[39m {\r\n    generatedMessage: \u001b[33mtrue\u001b[39m,\r\n    code: \u001b[32m'ERR_ASSERTION'\u001b[39m,\r\n    actual: [ \u001b[32m'boo